em-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Join our cult.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/0a/Join_our_cult..png/revision/latest?cb=20210321093510\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Join our cult.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/0a/Join_our_cult..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210321093510\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/0a/Join_our_cult..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210321093510 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/0/0a/Join_our_cult..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210321093510 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Join our cult.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Join_our_cult..png\" data-image-name=\"Join our cult..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\">9</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rose_Matafeo\" title=\"Rose Matafeo\">Rose Matafeo</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Clumpy_swayey_clumsy_man.\" title=\"Clumpy swayey clumsy man.\">Clumpy swayey clumsy man.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Butter_in_the_microwave.\" title=\"Butter in the microwave.\">Butter in the microwave.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Join our cult.</b></i> is the first episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\">Series 9</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 4 September 2019. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Rose_Matafeo\" title=\"Rose Matafeo\">Rose Matafeo</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Join_our_cult.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Join our cult\" was something that <a href=\"/wiki/Katy_Wix\" title=\"Katy Wix\">Katy Wix</a> and her four cult sisters urged <a href=\"/wiki/Alex_Horne\" title=\"Alex Horne\">Alex Horne</a> to do during the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_dramatic_entrance\" title=\"Make the most dramatic entrance\">Make the most dramatic entrance</a> task. The title card shows the goggles used in the <a href=\"/wiki/Arrange_the_lollies_in_rainbow_order_on_the_board_in_front_of_you\" title=\"Arrange the lollies in rainbow order on the board in front of you\">Arrange the lollies in rainbow order on the board in front of you</a> task as the black paint on them dries.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Join_our_cult.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Kom ind i vores kult', which translates as 'Join our cult'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Liity kulttiimme', which translates as 'Join our cult'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Bli med i kulten vår', which translates as 'Join our cult'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title. <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Join_our_cult.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/David_Baddiel\" title=\"David Baddiel\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">David Baddiel</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Gamble\" title=\"Ed Gamble\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ed Gamble</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jo_Brand\" title=\"Jo Brand\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jo Brand</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Katy_Wix\" title=\"Katy Wix\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Katy Wix</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rose_Matafeo\" title=\"Rose Matafeo\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rose Matafeo</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_stressful_thing\" title=\"Most stressful thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most stressful thing.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Hide_three_aubergines_in_this_room\" title=\"Hide three aubergines in this room\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Hide three aubergines in this room.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS9E1&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS9E1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>3<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS9E1&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS9E1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Arrange_the_lollies_in_rainbow_order_on_the_board_in_front_of_you\" title=\"Arrange the lollies in rainbow order on the board in front of you\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Arrange the lollies in rainbow order on the board in front of you. You may only take off your goggles if you find the dodo. You may only accuse one thing of being a dodo.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_the_most_dramatic_entrance\" title=\"Make the most dramatic entrance\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make the most dramatic entrance.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draw_the_second_longest_snake\" title=\"Draw the second longest snake\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Draw the second longest snake. Your snake must be at least half an inch wide at all points. Your snake must be neatly curled up again after 3 minutes.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> Best snake.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>12<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS9E1&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS9E1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td>12<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-ScoresS9E1&#95;1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-ScoresS9E1-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">17\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Notes</b>\n</p>\n<div class=\"references-small\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-ScoresS9E1-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS9E1_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS9E1_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS9E1_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-ScoresS9E1_1-3\">1.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Whilst it took Alex 7:38 to find Jo's aubergines and 5:25 to find Katy's, Katy was awarded 3 points and Jo awarded 2 points, although Jo should have been awarded 3 points and Katy 2 points. The scores for the episode and total points for the series both reflect this unexplained change to the points said to be awarded for this task.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Join_our_cult.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/join-our-cult\"><i>Join our cult.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/71678-001\"><i>Join our cult.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141459\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.111 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.189 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 637/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25746/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 138/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1497/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800523/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  114.831  